  "Deal <color=#FFFC40>$2</color> ATK Psy damage to all foes $1 times, prioritizing foes that have not been attacked yet, inflict $3 stack of <link=\"s|193\"><u>[Sparks]</u></link> per hit of damage. Attacks on the same target will only deal $4 damage. \\nPassive: Increase the damage multiplier/healing of <link=\"s|194\"><u>[Dazzling Fireworks]</u></link> by <color=#FFFC40>$5</color>。\\n<b><size=28><color=#850101>Ice-cold juices and carbonated sodas, each sip is a gentle fight against the scorching sun, so let them take away the cares of summer.</color></size></b>": "",
