  "<size=27>Hale Summer Days <color=#0F69CB>Lv.$1</color></size>": "",
  "Restore 1 ally's HP by <color=#FFFC40>$1</color> ATK + <color=#FFFC40>$2</color> HP, increase their ATK by <color=#FFFC40>$3</color>, Ailment ACC by <color=#FFFC40>$4</color>, and DMG Dealt by <color=#FFFC40>$5</color>. Also, increase ATK (up to $8) by $6 of the target's Ailment ACC (up to $7 Ailment ACC).they can now inflict $9 <link=\"s|193\"><u>[Sparks]</u></link> stack after each hit of damage for $10 turns, up to inflicting $11 <link=\"s|193\"><u>[Sparks]</u></link>.\\n<b><size=28><color=#850101>The dreamy texture wraps around your companion to form a crystalline layer of protection, gently caressing every wound on a hot summer day.</color></size></b>": "",
