  "Sparks": "",
  "Your skills will inflict [Sparks] to foes. When they are defeated, randomly spread their [Sparks] to other foes. After any ally used a skill and the foes have $1 stacks of [Sparks], you will trigger [Dazzling Fireworks]: Remove a total of $2 stacks of [Sparks] from all foes, deal Psy damage to all foes and decrease their DMG Dealt; Restore a certain amount of HP to all allies.": "",
  "<color=#66ccff>[Dazzling Fireworks]</color>": "",
  "Dazzling Fireworks": "",
  "After any ally used a skill and the foes have $1 stacks of [Sparks], you will trigger [Dazzling Fireworks]: Remove a total of $2 stacks of [Sparks] from all foes, deal Psy damage to all foes and decrease their DMG Dealt; Restore a certain amount of HP to all allies.": "",
  "{{A}}'s skills will inflict foes with [Sparks].\\nAfter any ally used a skill and the foes have $1 stacks of [Sparks], {{A}} will trigger a Follow Up: For every $2 stacks of [Sparks] removed, deal $4 ATK Psy damage to all foes and decrease their DMG Dealt by $5 for $6 turn; Restore $8 ATK + $9/$10/$11 HP (Change when reaching level $12, $13, $14), removes different amounts of [Sparks] in the same Follow Up, up to triggering $15 times (That damage cannot trigger the effect of inflicting [Sparks] from skills).\\nChanges Follow Up damage based on the number of foes, when there are $16/$17/>=$18 foes, the Follow Up will deal $19/$20/$21 of its original damage. This Follow Up cannot decrease foes' Down Points. When the foe is defeated, randomly spreads their [Sparks] to other foes.": "",
  "Arrival of Promised Light": "",
  "Decrease all foes' DEF by $1 when they took damage from <link=\"s|194\"><u>[Dazzling Fireworks]</u></link> for $3 turns, up to $2 stacks. \\n[Hale Summer Days] now heals all allies.": "",
